strikes, unleash an arsenal of devastating attacks upon your adversaries. Engage in lightning-fast team-based clashes, where tactical positioning and lightning reflexes are the keys to victory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SELECT YOUR POPE</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406870/extras/e5967a2ade64ad62e3c68aef95c7373b.poster.avif?t=1740955696\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406870/extras/e5967a2ade64ad62e3c68aef95c7373b.webm?t=1740955696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406870/extras/e5967a2ade64ad62e3c68aef95c7373b.mp4?t=1740955696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>DEAL DAMAGE!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pope Urban VI</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406870/extras/e29c08b7ce92a12db8e1b0ddac71a330.avif?t=1740955696\" /></span><br>- Base Health: 300hp<br>- Basic Attack: MELEE Base Damage 10hp<br>- Block: Block all damage for 2 frames.  Cost: 50 Force of God.<br>- <strong>Passive</strong>: &quot;The Elected&quot;After using POMPOUS, Urban does 2x melee damage for 1.5s.<br><br><strong>Ability 1</strong> - MONK'S PRAYER<br>- Heal, base 12hp,  5s cooldown<br><br><strong>Ability 2</strong> - POMPOUS<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406870/extras/20132505817177d46e96f5665d30981d.poster.avif?t=1740955696\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406870/extras/20132505817177d46e96f5665d30981d.webm?t=1740955696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406870/extras/20132505817177d46e96f5665d30981d.mp4?t=1740955696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Shoots a deadly flaming Skull at his opponents, exploding into a firey rage of arrogant energy. <br>- base dmg 70hp<br>- base fire 8 dmg (DPS).  <br>- 9s cooldown<br>- Fire Lifespan: 5s<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Artists</h2>The Original, The Great Armando (contact me if you find this!)<br><br>@kalengophiri<br>@kayaur<br>@unclecellphone<br>@sventhole<br>@toymaster<br><br>Game brought to you by, and made using unclenomics:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406870/extras/96e199bb66683b6bca2415a36abfea4a.webp?t=1740955696\" /></span>",
